    "details": "<p><strong>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Electrical Engineering (EE)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad</strong></p>\n<p>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; EE is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, designed to help aspiring electrical engineers assess and strengthen their technical preparation for the upcoming internship season.</p>\n<p>The assessment focuses on fundamental concepts and problem-solving abilities across major areas of Electrical Engineering, providing participants with an opportunity to evaluate their conceptual clarity and technical aptitude.</p>\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Evaluate fundamentals of Electrical Machines.</li>\n<li>Strengthen understanding of Power Systems.</li>\n<li>Assess knowledge of Electrical Circuits and Network Theory.</li>\n<li>Test concepts related to Control Systems.</li>\n<li>Evaluate understanding of Power Electronics.</li>\n<li>Encourage analytical and application-based problem-solving.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop.</li>\n<li>Participants must complete the assessment within the stipulated time.</li>\n<li>Submissions will be evaluated based on predefined criteria.</li>\n<li>Any unfair practice or plagiarism is strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li>The decision of the organizing team will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Power Your Knowledge. Strengthen Your Fundamentals.</strong></p>",
